@startuml workflow
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam roundCorner 10

rectangle "Student Developer" as Student
rectangle "Class & Team Workspace" as Class
rectangle "Project Tasks\n(Planned / In Progress)" as Tasks
rectangle "Evidence Submission\n& Rule-Based Scorer" as Evidence
rectangle "Teacher / Instructor\n(Verification Authority)" as Teacher
rectangle "Contribution Ledger\n& Student XP" as Ledger
cloud "GitHub API\n(Commits & PRs)" as GitHub

Student -right-> Class : enrolls via code
Class -down-> Tasks : organizes work
Student -down-> Tasks : updates progress
Tasks -right-> Evidence : submits completion proof
GitHub -down-> Evidence : syncs repo telemetry
Evidence -down-> Teacher : presents confidence score
Teacher -left-> Tasks : approves or rejects
Teacher -down-> Ledger : confirms completion
Ledger -left-> Student : awards verified XP

@enduml
